{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32580","headline":"秋日山斋书怀 · 刘沧","name":"秋日山斋书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啓户清风枕簟幽，虫丝吹落挂帘钩。\n蝉吟高树雨初霁，人忆故乡山正秋。\n浩渺蒹葭连夕照，萧疎杨柳隔沙洲。\n空将方寸荷知己，身寄烟萝恩未酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}